# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fuzzer run artifacts (defect D-2 hygiene)
# libFuzzer/AFL++ drop reproducers and scratch output into the working tree when
# a run is launched from the repo root. Ignore them so `git status` stays clean
# and a careless `git add -A` can never commit a crash blob. These patterns are
# unanchored (match in any dir) but do NOT shadow the curated, tracked seeds
# under corpus/ and corpus/regression/ (none of those filenames use these
# prefixes). CI additionally writes to a scratch dir so the tracked corpus/ is
# never mutated — this is a belt-and-braces local safety net.
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
oom-*
slow-unit-*
# AFL++ output / findings directories and its scratch input file
findings-*/
.cur_input
# default libFuzzer fork-mode logs
fuzz-*.log

# debug information files
*.dwo

# test output & cache
Testing/
.cache/
